; ========================================
; ＞『殺人現場』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走进了招待所中最靠前的，<br>也就是发生了火灾的那一间——<br>【火精之室】。|#0103Adv20_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格已经先到一步。|#0103Adv20_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛，你也来了。|#0103Adv20_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:现场的火势早已扑灭，<br>室内仍飘荡着焦糊的气味。|#0103Adv20_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看样子，内部结构基本完好，没遭受太大的损害。|#0103Adv20_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:家具虽然覆盖着黑色的烟灰，<br>却依然保持着原有的形状。|#0103Adv20_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在狭小的室内，<br>那幅无法逃避的景象映入眼帘。|#0103Adv20_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:290_2

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的遗体仍被绳索<br>悬挂在天花板的横梁上。|#0103Adv20_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜……|#0103Adv20_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛咬紧牙关，强迫自己冷静下来，<br>开始用手机拍摄现场。|#0103Adv20_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:1.2
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

