@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-4
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-4 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:烟雾散去后，<br>一切都变得清晰可见。|#0103Adv20_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:横梁上悬挂着汉娜的尸体。|#0103Adv20_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在她的身旁，还悬挂着许多<br>以囚犯少女们为原型<br>制作的人偶，簇拥着她。|#0103Adv20_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这该不会是，<br>汉娜一直在手工制作的人偶……？|#0103Adv20_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。她为每个人都做了。<br>虽然她不太坦率，<br>但真的很关心同伴呢。|#0103Adv20_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使咬着嘴唇，<br>艾玛的眼泪还是快要夺眶而出。|#0103Adv20_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不能哭！我已经下定决心要查明<br>　汉娜死亡的真相！）|#0103Adv20_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛强迫自己冷静下来，<br>环视房间四周。|#0103Adv20_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（房间里一片狼藉……<br>　这里到底发生了什么……？）|#0103Adv20_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『ロープ』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-14
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-14 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:正在拍摄现场时，<br>玛格走到艾玛身边。|#0103Adv20_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，火灾中好像只有这个<br>掉下来了，我就交给你了。|#0103Adv20_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格递过来的，<br>是一个做成艾玛模样的人偶。|#0103Adv20_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『焦げた人形』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-7
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-7 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（汉娜说过，<br>　她在准备礼物）|#0103Adv20_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（一定就是这个——）|#0103Adv20_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:手工缝制的，<br>以艾玛为原型的人偶传来温暖的触感。<br>接过人偶的艾玛双手颤抖。|#0103Adv20_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:奇怪了……|#0103Adv20_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到这句低语，<br>艾玛转头望去。<br>玛格正困惑地歪着头。|#0103Adv20_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:……怎么了？发现什么可疑的地方了吗？|#0103Adv20_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不，虽然调查了现场还什么都不清楚，<br>但是……其实我昨晚来过这里。<br>|#0103Adv20_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸！？|#0103Adv20_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为说出来可能会显得很可疑，<br>所以不太想说……<br>但我在这里举行了魔法仪式。|#0103Adv20_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:仪式？<br>是之前说的那本魔女的书上记载的……？|#0103Adv20_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:是的。而且这个房间在就寝时间前，<br>应该被看守锁上了才对。<br>然后当我们因火灾赶来的时候……|#0103Adv20_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……门是锁着的。|#0103Adv20_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（又来了。又是密室杀人……！<br>　为什么总是这样……！）|#0103Adv20_Ema011|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的尸体状况，<br>现场悬挂的人偶，<br>火灾、密室……全都充满谜团呢。|#0103Adv20_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……|#0103Adv20_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:初步调查结束后，<br>没有发现其他线索，于是艾玛离开了现场。|#0103Adv20_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

